# The first request of a file names a cost model: the models are defined
# before the English is read, so "under zen4" makes zen4 the active one
simplify nofile under zen4, x in [1, 2], y in [3, 4]
```glsl
float f(float x, float y) { double a = x, b = y; return float(a * a - b * b); }
```
# a comment's words ask for nothing: a run of the shader is not what
# this comment requests, the line under it does
simplify nofile under gt1030, x in [1, 2], y in [3, 4]
```glsl
float f(float x, float y) { double a = x, b = y; return float(a * a - b * b); }
```
